        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The employee will first be treated as a lateral transfer in accordance with (1) above. Once the lateral transfer wage rate and tenure step is determined, the appropriate promotion or demotion language contained in Article XI, Section 9, #144 (C) or #145 (D) or Article XI, Section 10, #147 (B) or #150 (D) shall be applied.",
